Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 20:15:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] proto: P2a-T0 multiWriterScan rejection in
 desugarMultiWriters

A name written by two or more nodes of which at least one is a scan node (plain + scan,
scan + scan) is rejected outright instead of skipped. Fixtures C9 (plain + scan), C9b
(scan + scan), accept-neighbour C9c (single scan writer + unrelated plain statement).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
